{{Game Book |lorename=none |author=[[Skyrim:Astrid|Astrid]] |description=An order for your life placed by the Dark Brotherhood |icon=SR-icon-book-Note1.png |id=0010596A |value=0 |weight=0 |loc=*Carried by [[Skyrim:Assassin|Assassins]] |note=1 }} As instructed, you are to eliminate <Alias=Player> by any means necessary. [[Skyrim:A Kiss, Sweet Mother|The Black Sacrament]] has been performed - somebody wants this poor fool dead.
We've already received payment for the contract. Failure is not an option.
- [[Skyrim:Astrid|Astrid]] {{Book End}}

