|loc=* [[Skyrim:Ilinalta's Deep|Ilinalta's Deep]] ([[Skyrim:Falkreath Hold|Falkreath Hold]]), underwater room, next to a submerged chest
* [[Skyrim:Kraldar's House|Kraldar's House]] ([[Skyrim:Winterhold|Winterhold]]), in a basket on the bookshelf next to the fireplace
* [[Skyrim:Snapleg Cave|Snapleg Cave]] ([[Skyrim:Eastmarch|Eastmarch]]), in one of the tents, sitting on a barrel
* 600 ft SSE of [[Skyrim:Steamcrag Camp|Steamcrag Camp]] ([[Skyrim:Eastmarch|Eastmarch]]), at the unmarked [[Skyrim:Shrine of Akatosh|Shrine of Akatosh]] {{Map Link|x=147283|y=-22157|zoom=17}}
* 460 ft NNE of [[Skyrim:Ysgramor's Tomb|Ysgramor's Tomb]] ([[Skyrim:Winterhold (region)|Winterhold]]), on a barrel near [[sr:Ilas-Tei|Ilas-Tei's]] corpse {{Map Link|x=99749|y=129109|zoom=17}}
* [[Skyrim:Apocrypha|Apocrypha]]{{DB}}, [[Skyrim:Apocrypha (The Hidden Twilight)#Chapter V|The Hidden Twilight]], Chapter V
}}

{{Mod Header|Hearthfire}} [[Category:Skyrim-Hearthfire]] [[Category:Skyrim-Hearthfire-Items]] {{Game Book |lorename=none |author=[[Skyrim:Rochelle_the_Red|Rochelle the Red]] |icon=SR-icon-book-Note4.png |mod=[[Skyrim:Hearthfire|Hearthfire]] |id=xx0008AE |value=0 |weight=0 |loc= |note=1 }} <font face='$HandwrittenFont'> While you were away, we came to visit your lovely new house. <Alias=Spouse> made us feel right at home. In fact, we liked <Alias.PronounObj=Spouse> so much we took <Alias.PronounObj=Spouse> back to <Alias=BanditDungeon> with us.
If you want <Alias=Spouse> back, come see me. Bring <Global=BYOHHBA2Ransom> gold and I'll discuss letting <Alias.PronounObj=Spouse> go.
[[Skyrim:Rochelle_the_Red|Rochelle the Red]] </font> {{Book End}}

'''Fixture excerpt''' of Skyrim:Unobtainable Items -- two sections only.

